msgstr "Fly close — a countdown starts. Destroy the bunker in the center before it runs out; flak hits from afar, come in fast."

#: game/scripts/hud_codex.gd:101 game/scripts/hud_flight.gd:382 game/scripts/hud_flight.gd:398
