msgstr "Cruiser in position. The sky is yours."

#: game/scripts/warship.gd:27
msgid "Всем башням: цель воздушная, огонь по готовности."
msgstr "All turrets: air target, fire when ready."

#: game/scripts/warship.gd:27
msgid "Пролив наш. Сбейте его."
msgstr "The strait is ours. Shoot him down."

